{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_583410B0","title":"Bannor discusses the state of Nivalis","entry":"Dlg_583410B0::entry","exit":"Dlg_583410B0::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_4FDC34EC","articyId":"72057645577538043","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Hey boss, looks like you're settling in ok. How about an update?","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey boss, looks like you're settling in ok. How about an update?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":500.0,"y":1100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24537","byteOffset":17158920,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_9ABB8DF9","articyId":"72057645577538092","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Well, where should we start? The LUZ isn't going away any time soon. Comms are still down. And the noodle business... well it might pay the bills... just. But it ain't gonna fund the future you dream of.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, where should we start? The LUZ isn't going away any time soon. Comms are still down. And the noodle business... well it might pay the bills... just. But it ain't gonna fund the future you dream of.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1150.0,"y":1075.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33001","byteOffset":20369472,"byteLength":620}},{"id":"DFr_88EFF3F3","articyId":"72057821671255566","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"The veggies cost us a fortune every day! The greengrocer right now is probably looking for a condo in the Spire.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The veggies cost us a fortune every day! The greengrocer right now is probably looking for a condo in the Spire.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18614","byteOffset":14928752,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_04ED3021","articyId":"72057821671255604","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"You bet.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You bet.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5700.0,"y":1100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47976","byteOffset":32487168,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_32ECDD97","articyId":"72057606922883081","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Oh, don't be. I'm sure we're fine.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, don't be. I'm sure we're fine.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":1275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32981","byteOffset":20361744,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_F10F10C1","articyId":"72057645577538049","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure.","TextSheVersion":"Sure.","TextTheyVersion":"Sure."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":825.0,"y":1100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45786","byteOffset":31653504,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_75782F1C","articyId":"72057821671255478","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Banor","text":"The boom will last a while, but it ain't permanent. Now's the time to make some money and invest in a second restaurant. But for that you gotta increase your profit!","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The boom will last a while, but it ain't permanent. Now's the time to make some money and invest in a second restaurant. But for that you gotta increase your profit!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32536","byteOffset":20192472,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_EFCC725E","articyId":"72057821671255484","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I thought the business was doing ok?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I thought the business was doing ok?","TextSheVersion":"I thought the business was doing ok?","TextTheyVersion":"I thought the business was doing ok?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":1475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17861","byteOffset":14646320,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_2999F3B8","articyId":"72057821671255490","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Banor","text":"Well if it ain't a future where you eat out the trash recombinator, some stuff has got to change.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well if it ain't a future where you eat out the trash recombinator, some stuff has got to change.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":1475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18065","byteOffset":14721536,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_05301188","articyId":"72057821671255496","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How do you know which future I dream of?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do you know which future I dream of?","TextSheVersion":"How do you know which future I dream of?","TextTheyVersion":"How do you know which future I dream of?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":1475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35259","byteOffset":25699800,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_C21F7585","articyId":"72057821671255502","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Let's talk about the noodle bar.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Let's talk about the noodle bar.","TextSheVersion":"Let's talk about the noodle bar.","TextTheyVersion":"Let's talk about the noodle bar."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":1225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34241","byteOffset":20837152,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_E1D88D2D","articyId":"72057821671255508","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why are the Comms down?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why are the Comms down?","TextSheVersion":"Why are the Comms down?","TextTheyVersion":"Why are the Comms down?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28119","byteOffset":18521200,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_E6E31881","articyId":"72057821671255514","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What's happening with the LUZ?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's happening with the LUZ?","TextSheVersion":"What's happening with the LUZ?","TextTheyVersion":"What's happening with the LUZ?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52585","byteOffset":34307920,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_9562CCC4","articyId":"72057821671255520","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Banor","text":"It's all because of the LUZ. The Localized Unity Zone has taken a lot of stuff offline. I don't know why though. How does taking the Comms offline stop a serial killer?","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's all because of the LUZ. The Localized Unity Zone has taken a lot of stuff offline. I don't know why though. How does taking the Comms offline stop a serial killer?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30055","byteOffset":19250416,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_61BB4477","articyId":"72057821671255526","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It's sick! I hate the corps... But it's good for us?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's sick! I hate the corps... But it's good for us?","TextSheVersion":"It's sick! I hate the corps... But it's good for us?","TextTheyVersion":"It's sick! I hate the corps... But it's good for us?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":850.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31902","byteOffset":19950128,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_1CA3864E","articyId":"72057821671255532","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I still don't quite see ...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I still don't quite see ...","TextSheVersion":"I still don't quite see ...","TextTheyVersion":"I still don't quite see ..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20401","byteOffset":15600960,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_48EB8092","articyId":"72057821671255538","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Banor","text":"Look, I wasn't sure about the serial killer chat. \"The Aseptic\"? Sounded like scaremongering to me. But now... I'm not so sure. And the LUZ hasn't exactly been a problem for the people who count. The decision makers.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I wasn't sure about the serial killer chat. \"The Aseptic\"? Sounded like scaremongering to me. But now... I'm not so sure. And the LUZ hasn't exactly been a problem for the people who count. The decision makers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37569","byteOffset":28550624,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_F0CFB866","articyId":"72057821671255544","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How does this all affect us?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How does this all affect us?","TextSheVersion":"How does this all affect us?","TextTheyVersion":"How does this all affect us?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44281","byteOffset":31085864,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_EC2401FD","articyId":"72057821671255550","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Banor","text":"It's all about the corps. Business is up. Gawkers have flooded into the area. It's become trendy. Drink, dance and dine in the streets where the serial killer stalks the unwary!","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's all about the corps. Business is up. Gawkers have flooded into the area. It's become trendy. Drink, dance and dine in the streets where the serial killer stalks the unwary!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21640","byteOffset":16077168,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_055F5C31","articyId":"72057821671255560","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"With a greenhouse?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"With a greenhouse?","TextSheVersion":"With a greenhouse?","TextTheyVersion":"With a greenhouse?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":1100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36083","byteOffset":27998064,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_C2B40807","articyId":"72057821671255572","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Carrots shouldn't cost more than gold.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Carrots shouldn't cost more than gold.","TextSheVersion":"Carrots shouldn't cost more than gold.","TextTheyVersion":"Carrots shouldn't cost more than gold."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25094","byteOffset":17375384,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_A0E36727","articyId":"72057821671255578","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And how would I do that?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And how would I do that?","TextSheVersion":"And how would I do that?","TextTheyVersion":"And how would I do that?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16590","byteOffset":14170952,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_FABE5EFA","articyId":"72057821671